#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD0089 expect=skipped domain=TE
#note "TEDUR is not present in the dataset, so the wave E Requirements.Variables.All [TEENRL, TEDUR] leg is unmet and the parent SKIPS - before the Any -> All rewrite this file expected a violation at row 2. The finding is NOT lost: this dataset is byte-for-byte the R-5.25 split sibling FDA-SD0089-A's -violation_teenrl_blank scenario, which reports row 2 at its location. Four disjoint states: both present -> parent; one absent -> that column's sibling; neither -> the dataset sister."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TE label="Trial Elements"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col ETCD    type=Char label="Element Code"
col ELEMENT type=Char label="Description of Element"
col TESTRL  type=Char label="Rule for Start of Element"
col TEENRL  type=Char label="Rule for End of Element"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | TE | SCRN | Screening | Informed consent | End of screening
CDISCPILOT01 | TE | TRT | Treatment | First dose |
